LIABILITY WAIVER — EIGHT GATES RELEASE TRAINING
Restricted Taijutsu Program

Technique: Eight Gates Released Formation
Nature: Forbidden taijutsu — chakra gate release
Instructor of record: Might Guy (Maito Gai), elite Jonin

Warning: The human body's chakra flow is restrained by eight gates.
Forcing them open multiplies physical power far beyond normal limits,
but at severe cost. Opening the higher gates causes catastrophic muscle
and tissue damage. The Eighth Gate, the Gate of Death, grants power
surpassing a Kage at the certain cost of the user's life.

Acknowledgement: The undersigned understands that gate-release training
risks permanent injury or death, is not to be used except in the direst
circumstances, and is authorized only under direct instructor supervision.

